export anchor BorderRadius:
    description:
        Shorthand that rounds the component's corners. One value sets all corners; two set top-left/bottom-right then top-right/bottom-left; three set top-left, top-right/bottom-left, bottom-right; four set top-left, top-right, bottom-right, bottom-left. The background is clipped to the rounded shape.

    identifier: borderRadius

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `border-radius` property.

    values:
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`
        - `<top-left> <top-right>? <bottom-right>? <bottom-left>?`

    initial: 0

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            borderRadius: 8px
        \\\
        ```
